1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
99 bends to Heaven's Gate, or 24 wartime switchbacks — which would you drive? I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
Two of China's wildest mountain roads. You pick one.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,700
First: Tongtian Avenue up Tianmen Mountain, Hunan.

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,100
10.8 km, 99 hairpin bends, 200 up to 1,300 metres.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,600
Second: the 24-Zig road near Qinglong, Guizhou.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,100
Just 4 km — but 24 switchbacks stacked up the slope.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Double-tap for the road you'd rather drive.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,100
The 24-Zig hauled war supplies to the front in the 1940s.

9
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,800
★ Expert Tip: you ride Tianmen's shuttle — private cars can't take the 99 bends.

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,600
99 bends or 24 switchbacks? Tell me which below.
